]\nFemale voice, gentle and steady pace. Dialogue: \"想要省心换发色，就选这款韩金靓易梳彩。一按一梳就能上色，黑布林果香温和不伤头皮，染出来发色均匀透亮，喜欢直接拍下带回家。\"\n[Negative]\nFace changing, altered facial features, character drift, deformed limbs, object replacement, wrong hair dye product, changed comb design, changed product packaging, flickering hair, shaking camera, cartoon, painting, blurry, extra limbs, spider suit pattern changed.\n"}}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# 上传音频可以参考上传音频的音色\n\n# 注意: \n\n## 1. 这里只是参考上传音频的音色，不是完全将音频的语音进行对口型（如果是对口型口播或者唱歌需要对音频进行进一步处理匹配，这里只是作为参考音频的效果进行使用）\n\n## 2. 不想使用参考音频可以禁用掉，使用原始配音"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [815.2204483749874, 219.45397390126163], "pos": [2690.1102436840756, 2510.8433796466275], "id": 36, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 12, "widgets_values_named": {"text": "# 上传音频可以参考上传音频的音色\n\n# 注意: \n\n## 1. 这里只是参考上传音频的音色，不是完全将音频的语音进行对口型（如果是对口型口播或者唱歌需要对音频进行进一步处理匹配，这里只是作为参考音频的效果进行使用）\n\n## 2. 不想使用参考音频可以禁用掉，使用原始配音"}}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "OPT_CONNECTION", "label": "OPT_CONNECTION", "type": "*"}], "size": [387.7936332166927, 150.7109955384699], "pos": [3085.357825477453, 1212.2720794128074], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 37, "type": "Fast Groups Muter (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "showAllGraphs": true, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 13}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.58.5", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [-1171.3938635552952, -45.600780871983424], "scale": 0.23092115320381926}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "Models & Latents", "bounding": [3516.406204975154, 1136.8473500259856, 2922.9725778153793, 6